OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order after reports of
OL,4,Ayouths with machetes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have been granted additional
OL,7,Fpowers to tackle anti-social behaviour
OL,8,Fafter reports of groups of youths on
OL,9,Felectric bikes carrying machetes and
OL,10,Fchasing people.
OL,12,FMerseyside Police received reports of
OL,13,Fincidents at about 18:30 BST on Tuesday
OL,14,Fin the Prescot area.
OL,16,FInsp Louie Lyons said: "Armed officers
OL,17,Fare currently searching the area and
OL,18,Fenquiries are ongoing to find all of
OL,19,Fthose involved."
