OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order after reports of
OL,4,Ayouths with machetes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dispersal order will be in place
OL,7,Funtil 19:30 BST on Wednesday and
OL,8,Fincludes the area bounded by Liverpool
OL,9,FRoad/Derby Street, High
OL,10,FStreet/Warrington Road, Stoney Lane,
OL,11,FHalsnead Park (north of M62) and the
OL,12,FPrescot/Whiston side of the M57.
